// Output layout.
//
// niri picks sensible defaults for every connected screen, so this file is
// empty on purpose. Run `niri msg outputs` to see your screens' names, then
// add blocks like the example below to set mode, scale or position.
// Docs: https://github.com/YaLTeR/niri/wiki/Configuration:-Outputs
//
// output "eDP-1" {
//     mode "1920x1080@60"
//     scale 1.0
//     position x=0 y=0
// }
